# Prisma

- Schema: `web/prisma/schema.prisma`. Server code imports `sqlClient` from `@/lib/prismadb` (it is `server-only`).
- `bun run sql:generate` runs `prisma generate` (client in `web/prisma/generated/client`, linked into `node_modules/.prisma/client` by `scripts/link-prisma-client-default.js`) and regenerates the relation graph. Use it, not `bunx prisma generate`.
- The schema is applied with `prisma db push`, not migrations: deploys run it in `web/bin/deploy-lib.sh`, then apply `web/prisma/views/*.sql`. `bun run dbpush` uses the `DATABASE_URL` in `web/.env.local` only, and that may point at production.
- App datetimes are BigInt epoch ms (`getUtcNowEpoch()`); no `DateTime` or `@default(now())` on app models. The Better Auth models keep `DateTime`.
- Type-safe queries; a transaction for multi-step writes; log errors with `logger`.
